 ╭─ Keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
 │ z / Z      toggle branch / collapse all                                      │
 │                                                                              │
 │ branch or item                                                               │
 │ o          open PR(s) / item in browser                                      │
 │ y          copy name(s) / path / sha / url                                   │
 │ Y          copy changed file paths                                           │
 │ e          edit file in $EDITOR                                              │
 │ c          checkout branch                                                   │
 │ M          merge PR (and below)                                              │
 │ D          toggle PR(s) draft / ready (selection or hovered)                 │
 │ A          ask reviewers (selection or hovered, draft or ready)              │
 │                                                                              │
 │ stack                                                                        │
 │ p          push                                                              │
 │ s          sync                                                              │
 │ P          sync --prune                                                      │
 │ S          submit --auto                                                     │
 │ rr ru rd   rebase all/upstack/downstack                                      │
 │ rc ra      rebase continue/abort                                             │
 │ a          add branch                                                        │
 │ m          modify (interactive)                                              │
 │ u          unstack                                                           │
 │ :          run gh stack …                                                    │
 │                                                                              │
 │ review                                                                       │
 │ space      mark branch                                                       │
 │ v          visual range                                                      │
 ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── ↑15 ↓19 ─╯
  j/k scroll  ctrl+d/u half page  g/G top/end  esc close
